{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-16T04:07:41.807Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7ba3d75f240c935b707fc14c","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1456","lineage:pm-gh1456","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-gh1456","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1456","lineage:pm-gh1456","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Observed (pm 2026.10.15; also on 2026.10.14)\n\nA dependency row with only `id` and `kind` (no `created_at`) makes `pm get` crash with an unhandled TypeError:\n\n```console\n$ pm update rp-xhnl --dep \"id=rp-138k,kind=blocks\" --dep \"id=rp-ono1,kind=related\"\n# then the dependency table in tasks/rp-xhnl.toon is reduced to\n#   dependencies[2]{id,kind}:\n#     rp-138k,blocks\n#     rp-ono1,related\n$ pm get rp-xhnl\nCannot read properties of undefined (reading 'localeCompare')\n$ pm list --limit 5     # still works\n$ pm validate           # no check flags the malformed dependency rows\n```\n\nSupplying `created_at` on each dependency makes the item readable again. A single dependency row without `created_at` does not crash; two or more do. That suggests the dependency sort compares `created_at` with `localeCompare` without guarding against `undefined`.\n\n## How agents hit this\n\nDependency rows written by imports, by hand-edited `.toon` files, by other implementations of the format, or by older tools can lack `created_at`. pm-rust's differential suite hit it with fixture items, and pm-rust now has to keep timestamps in every fixture row to work around it. For an agent, the failure is opaque: no item id, no field name, no recovery hint, and `pm validate` reports nothing.\n\n## Expected\n\n- Reading an item never crashes on a missing optional dependency field. Sort with a stable fallback, for example by `created_at` when present, then `kind`, then `id`.\n- Or, if `created_at` is meant to be required, `pm validate` / `pm health` names the item and dependency rows. Reads then fail with a typed, actionable error that has a recovery command, not a TypeError."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-gh1482"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1482: pm get crashes with TypeError (localeCompare) when two or more dependency rows lack created_at, and pm validate does not flag them"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GitHub report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1482. Reading multiple dependency rows missing timestamps yields a stable safe result or a typed actionable diagnostic, and validation exposes malformed required data."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:sdk","github-intake"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-16T04:07:41.807Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-16T04:07:41.807Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":120},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Two or more dependency rows without created_at never produce an unhandled TypeError; Ordering or typed refusal is deterministic and documents recovery; Validation and health expose required-field defects where appropriate"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-33cw"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"Reading multiple dependency rows missing timestamps yields a stable safe result or a typed actionable diagnostic, and validation exposes malformed required data."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Reporter reproduction retained in the body; implementation and installed-artifact acceptance remain pending."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-16T04:07:41.807Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check 2026-10-16: strict complete all-status corpus of 2971 items with zero omissions plus request-specific keyword searches and live open/in_progress reads. No item references GH-1482. Existing foundational owners retain their prior completed scope; this child records the distinct newly reported defect. Kept open and unclaimed while finishing PR 1479."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/escape_class","value":"production_defect"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"1a751abe4b3ec3f78586e1014bda48283e2eaf120bf8fad913c6b9db61eee506","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"7495e7b7f3b05a82b6a771eb6d6e57e6d2e9937512a744f8777bded4e2188f02"}
